{"3058770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dragrave Marauders", "steam_appid": 3058770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Dragrave Marauders]  <br>Choose your starting class and start as a raider looting an abandoned castle. As you venture deeper into the castle, you realize that there is a bigger story at play here. Adventure with the deuteragonist, &quot;Lone Warrior&quot;, explore many new lands, to collect all the Elemental World Crystals and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[IMPORTANT]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your screen starts freezing, but you are still able to move and hear sounds, and it happens often, please restart your PC and the problem should be resolved. Added charms to the game which modified the terms, so in order to use them, you must start a new game.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Press f4 for Fullscreen!]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Guide]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1: Just enter Castle Dragrave and keep moving foward. Lasciva can be found when you are at the entrance of Castle Dragrave, and you head east.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 2: Exit Riah City, head north of the Dune to the lake. Walk all the way to the end of the lake and you will see a Jetty. Go to the edge of the Jetty and press enter. Once you gotten the Water Crystal, go back to the Queen and then go back to the Dune, head east and enter the Wind Temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 3: Enter Eternal Spring Forest and turn right. You will find a Shaman's Hut. Talk to her and make sure you receive access to the Earth Temple from her. Head to Archville, north of Eternal Spring Forest.  Walk north of Archville to travel to the Forest Heart. Walk to the top left entrance. Keep walking until you reach the Earth Temple. Complete the Earth Temple and it's Guardian to get the crystal; then head back to the Shaman to get permission to enter the Light Temple. Now head back the to Forest heart and enter the top right entrance. Keep walking until you reach the Light Temple. Get the Light Crystal and then head back to the Shaman and talk to her one last time. Head back to Tropical Bay. Chapter 4 is now unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 4: Enter Mount CInder &amp; make your way to Cindor. Exit Cindor to Inner Mount Cindor, move forward and enter the fire temple. Clear the Fire Temple, get the Crystal and then head back the Falcon's Reach. Chapter 5 unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Dragrave Marauders]  <br>Choose your starting class and start as a raider looting an abandoned castle. As you venture deeper into the castle, you realize that there is a bigger story at play here. Adventure with the deuteragonist, &quot;Lone Warrior&quot;, explore many new lands, to collect all the Elemental World Crystals and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[IMPORTANT]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your screen starts freezing, but you are still able to move and hear sounds, and it happens often, please restart your PC and the problem should be resolved. Added charms to the game which modified the terms, so in order to use them, you must start a new game.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Press f4 for Fullscreen!]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Guide]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1: Just enter Castle Dragrave and keep moving foward. Lasciva can be found when you are at the entrance of Castle Dragrave, and you head east.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 2: Exit Riah City, head north of the Dune to the lake. Walk all the way to the end of the lake and you will see a Jetty. Go to the edge of the Jetty and press enter. Once you gotten the Water Crystal, go back to the Queen and then go back to the Dune, head east and enter the Wind Temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 3: Enter Eternal Spring Forest and turn right. You will find a Shaman's Hut. Talk to her and make sure you receive access to the Earth Temple from her. Head to Archville, north of Eternal Spring Forest.  Walk north of Archville to travel to the Forest Heart. Walk to the top left entrance. Keep walking until you reach the Earth Temple. Complete the Earth Temple and it's Guardian to get the crystal; then head back to the Shaman to get permission to enter the Light Temple. Now head back the to Forest heart and enter the top right entrance. Keep walking until you reach the Light Temple. Get the Light Crystal and then head back to the Shaman and talk to her one last time. Head back to Tropical Bay. Chapter 4 is now unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 4: Enter Mount CInder &amp; make your way to Cindor. Exit Cindor to Inner Mount Cindor, move forward and enter the fire temple. Clear the Fire Temple, get the Crystal and then head back the Falcon's Reach. Chapter 5 unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dragrave Marauders is a fantasy RPG inspired by a beloved game, which blends parody with a deeper story. It offers turn-based RPG combat and a decent amount of play-time across 6 Chapters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058770/header.jpg?t=1788096715", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058770/a75857744d14a0cf8502c2bab66c4eaf04f5383e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788096715", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058770/a75857744d14a0cf8502c2bab66c4eaf04f5383e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788096715", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["huntikgooo1"], "publishers": ["huntikgooo1"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058770/763f305aabec4f697ebbf4df999eb10be4a5591a/ss_763f305aabec4f697ebbf4df999eb10be4a5591a.600x338.jpg?t=1788096715", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058770/763f305aabec4f697ebbf4df999eb10be4a5591a/ss_763f305aabec4f697ebbf4df999eb10be4a5591a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788096715"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058770/555e7ed981f9e88ed9334f0b8613c6e016993e34/ss_555e7ed981f9e88ed9334f0b8613c6e016993e34.600x338.jpg?t=1788096715", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058770/555e7ed981f9e88ed9334f0b8613c6e016993e34/ss_555e7ed981f9e88ed9334f0b8613c6e016993e34.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788096715"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058770/a0a58bd97d3b3cf383f486433ea843ab91737c80/ss_a0a58bd97d3b3cf383f486433ea843ab91737c80.600x338.jpg?t=1788096715", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058770/a0a58bd97d3b3cf383f486433ea843ab91737c80/ss_a0a58bd97d3b3cf383f486433ea843ab91737c80.19